# Reference netlist; all switch contacts are normally open to ground.
J1 Pico: VBUS=USB_5V; GND=GND; GP10=LEVEL_0; GP11=LEVEL_1; GP12=LEVEL_2; GP13=LEVEL_3; GP14=LEVEL_4; GP15=MARK_BUTTON
S1 reed level 0: LEVEL_0 to GND
S2 reed level 1: LEVEL_1 to GND
S3 reed level 2: LEVEL_2 to GND
S4 reed level 3: LEVEL_3 to GND
S5 reed level 4: LEVEL_4 to GND
S6 mark button: MARK_BUTTON to GND
